---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = "Essential Chinese Phrases for Travelers";
const description = "Learn these basic Chinese phrases before your trip — pronunciation, when to use them, and tips for being understood.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/zh/life/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>重返生活</a>
    </nav>
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">🗣️ 中国生活</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">旅行者必备的汉语短语</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">十几个短语会改变人们对待你的方式。</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 最后更新日期：2026年6月</span>
        <span>⏱️ 阅读4分钟</span>
      </div>
    </header>

        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-green-50 to-emerald-50 border-l-4 border-green-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-4">🎯 快速回答</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-green-800 leading-relaxed">在中国旅行，你不需要说中文。但是学习十几个短语会让你的旅行变得更好——当地人真的很感激你的努力，你会发现自己在市场上得到了更好的服务、更温暖的笑容，甚至更优惠的价格。</p>
    </div>

        <nav class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">📋 在本指南中</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-3">
        <li><a href="#greetings" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">👋 问候和礼貌</a></li>
        <li><a href="#eating" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🍽️ 用餐与点餐</a></li>
        <li><a href="#shopping" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🛍️ 购物与价格</a></li>
        <li><a href="#getting-around" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🚇 出行</a></li>
        <li><a href="#emergencies" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🆘 紧急情况</a></li>
        <li><a href="#pronunciation" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🎵 发音技巧</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="greetings" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">👋</span>问候和礼貌</h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-6 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">英语</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">中文</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">汉语拼音</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">备注</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">你好</td><td class="px-6 py-4">你好</td><td class="px-6 py-4">N</td><td class="px-6 py-4">随时随地与任何人一起使用</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">非常感谢。</td><td class="px-6 py-4">谢谢</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Xi Xi</td><td class="px-6 py-4">经常说——人们会注意到</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">对不起/打扰一下</td><td class="px-6 py-4">对不起</td><td class="px-6 py-4">杜</td><td class="px-6 py-4">如果你撞到某人</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">没关系</td><td class="px-6 py-4">没关系</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Méi guān xi</td><td class="px-6 py-4">对“对不起”的回应</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">再见</td><td class="px-6 py-4">再见</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Zài jiàn</td><td class="px-6 py-4">标准告别</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-12"><strong>提示：</strong>在餐馆、商店、出租车上，每次交易后都要说“谢谢”。它在日常互动中发挥了重要作用。</p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="eating" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🍽️</span>用餐与点餐</h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-12 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">English</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">中文</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">Pinyin</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">Notes</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">麻烦请结帐</td><td class="px-6 py-4">买单</td><td class="px-6 py-4">毛丹</td><td class="px-6 py-4">轻轻挥手</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">美味的</td><td class="px-6 py-4">好吃！</td><td class="px-6 py-4">嗨，嗨！</td><td class="px-6 py-4">赞美厨师</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">不要加辣</td><td class="px-6 py-4">不加辣</td><td class="px-6 py-4">布贾拉</td><td class="px-6 py-4">四川/湖南必备</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">请给我水</td><td class="px-6 py-4">请给我水</td><td class="px-6 py-4">吴</td><td class="px-6 py-4">不要喝自来水</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="shopping" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🛍️</span>购物与价格</h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-12 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">English</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">中文</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">Pinyin</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">Notes</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">多少？</td><td class="px-6 py-4">多少钱？</td><td class="px-6 py-4">你知道吗？</td><td class="px-6 py-4">普遍价格问题</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">太贵了</td><td class="px-6 py-4">太贵了</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Tài guìle</td><td class="px-6 py-4">仅在市场</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">你能把它降下来吗？</td><td class="px-6 py-4">便宜一点？</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Pián yíyìdi.n？</td><td class="px-6 py-4">在市场而非商店使用</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">我要了</td><td class="px-6 py-4">我要这个</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Wào zhège</td><td class="px-6 py-4">当你决定了</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="getting-around" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🚇</span>出行</h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-6 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">English</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">中文</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">Pinyin</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">Notes</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">在哪里。。。？</td><td class="px-6 py-4">...在哪里？</td><td class="px-6 py-4">？</td><td class="px-6 py-4">显示中文地名</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">我要去这里</td><td class="px-6 py-4">去这里</td><td class="px-6 py-4">周</td><td class="px-6 py-4">向驾驶员显示地址</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">停在这里</td><td class="px-6 py-4">这里停</td><td class="px-6 py-4">热丁</td><td class="px-6 py-4">出租车</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">多久？</td><td class="px-6 py-4">多久？</td><td class="px-6 py-4">杜吉？</td><td class="px-6 py-4">旅行或等待时间</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-12"><strong>专业提示：</strong>始终用汉字显示您的目的地。</p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="emergencies" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🆘</span>紧急情况</h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-12 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">English</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">中文</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">Pinyin</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">Notes</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">帮助</td><td class="px-6 py-4">救命！</td><td class="px-6 py-4">京！</td><td class="px-6 py-4">仅适用于真正的紧急情况</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">报警</td><td class="px-6 py-4">报警</td><td class="px-6 py-4">吴</td><td class="px-6 py-4">紧急电话：110</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">我需要医生</td><td class="px-6 py-4">我需要医生</td><td class="px-6 py-4">吴</td><td class="px-6 py-4">紧急电话：120</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">我迷路了</td><td class="px-6 py-4">我迷路了</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Wílùle</td><td class="px-6 py-4">用中文显示目的地</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="pronunciation" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🎵</span>发音技巧</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">中文用法<strong>音调</strong>--同一个音节用不同的音调表示不同的意思。但不要过分强调。上下文通常会让你的意思清楚，当地人也会原谅游客。</p>

      <p class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">四种音调：</p>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-6 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">音调</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">示例</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">意义</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">描述</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">第一</td><td class="px-6 py-4">mā（她）</td><td class="px-6 py-4">妈妈</td><td class="px-6 py-4">平坦、高音</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">第二</td><td class="px-6 py-4">má</td><td class="px-6 py-4">使麻木</td><td class="px-6 py-4">上升音高</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">第三</td><td class="px-6 py-4">m（马）</td><td class="px-6 py-4">马</td><td class="px-6 py-4">先降后升</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">第四</td><td class="px-6 py-4">mà（马）</td><td class="px-6 py-4">责骂</td><td class="px-6 py-4">急剧下降</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-12"><strong>最佳提示：</strong>慢慢地说清楚。大多数中国人已经习惯了外国人在音调上的挣扎，并会努力理解。</p>
    </div>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">📚 相关指南</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/zh/life/survival-kit/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">🎒 您的中国之旅生存工具包</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">完整的旅行前检查表</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/life/essential-apps/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">📱 中国需要的10个应用程序</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">包括翻译工具在内的基本应用程序</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/tips/cultural-taboos/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">🏮 文化的注意事项</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">自信地应对社交场合</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  
    <!-- Sources -->
    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">来源</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
        <li>语言参考——没有单一的官方来源。</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>